"F2/F3 fixture: LP block FIRST, then 6 SDP blocks of size 3 (m=18)."
"   Constraint triple (3g-2, 3g-1, 3g) touches SDP block g+1 via"
"   E11/E22/E33 (1 nonzero per 3x3 block = 11%, stays sparse)."
